    "semantic_summary": "SceneList is a controller component responsible for managing the display and lifecycle of scenes within a project context. It fetches existing scene assets from the backend via AssetService upon project input change. It provides UI methods to open a creation modal and handles the logic for uploading new scene files to the server, ensuring the scene list is refreshed upon successful creation."
